     1,
     "<div style=\"font-weight:normal\"><div><span>Dear all,</span></div><div><span><br></span></div><div><span>Sorry</span><span> </span><span>for</span><span> </span><span>reactivating</span><span> </span><span>this</span><span> </span><span>thread</span><span> </span><span>(</span><span>and</span><span> </span><span>for</span><span> </span><span>re</span><span>-</span><span>posting</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>I</span><span> </span><span>had</span><span> </span><span>copied</span><span> </span><span>the</span><span> </span><span>wrong</span><span> </span><span>syntax</span><span>)</span><span>, </span><span>but</span><span> </span><span>I</span><span> </span><span>was</span><span> </span><span>just</span><span> </span><span>searching</span><span> </span><span>for</span><span> </span><span>definition</span><span> </span><span>variables</span><span> </span><span>and</span><span> </span><span>came</span><span> </span><span>across</span><span> </span><span>this</span><span> </span><span>post</span><span>. </span><span>From</span><span> </span><span>my</span><span> </span><span>understanding</span><span>, </span><span>lavaan</span><span> </span><span>allows</span><span> </span><span>for</span><span> </span><span>multi</span><span>-</span><span>group</span><span> </span><span>models</span><span> </span><span>and</span><span> </span><span>for</span><span> </span><span>specifying</span><span> </span><span>group</span><span>-</span><span>specific</span><span> </span><span>parameter</span><span> </span><span>constraints</span><span> </span><span>(</span><span>e.g</span><span>.</span><span>,</span><span> </span><span>fixing</span><span> </span><span>loadings</span><span> </span><span>to</span><span> </span><span>different</span><span> </span><span>values</span><span> </span><span>in</span><span> </span><span>different</span><span> </span><span>groups</span><span>)</span><span>. </span><span>I</span><span> </span><span>just</span><span> </span><span>realized</span><span> </span><span>that</span><span>, </span><span>in</span><span> </span><span>most</span><span> </span><span>cases</span><span>, </span><span>models</span><span> </span><span>with</span><span> </span><span>definition</span><span> </span><span>variables</span><span> </span><span>are</span><span> </span><span>just</span><span> </span><span>that</span><span>:</span><span> </span><span>Multi</span><span>-</span><span>group</span><span> </span><span>models</span><span> </span><span>with</span><span> </span><span>some</span><span> </span><span>parameters</span><span> </span><span>being</span><span> </span><span>fixed</span><span> </span><span>to</span><span> </span><span>group</span><span>-</span><span>specific</span><span> </span><span>values</span><span>. </span><span>So</span><span>, </span><span>I</span><span> </span><span>was</span><span> </span><span>wondering</span><span> </span><span>if</span><span> </span><span>I</span><span> </span><span>could</span><span> </span><span>trick</span><span> </span><span>lavaan</span><span> </span><span>into</span><span> </span><span>setting</span><span> </span><span>up</span><span> </span><span>a</span><span> </span><span>latent</span><span> </span><span>growth</span><span> </span><span>curve</span><span> </span><span>model</span><span> </span><span>with</span><span> </span><span>subject</span><span>-</span><span>specific</span><span> </span><span>slope</span><span>-</span><span>loadings</span><span> </span><span>by</span><span> </span><span>making</span><span> </span><span>use</span><span> </span><span>of</span><span> </span><span>the</span><span> </span><span>multi</span><span>-</span><span>group</span><span> </span><span>implementation</span><span> </span><span>of</span><span> </span><span>lavaan</span><span>. </span><span>Unfortunately</span><span>, </span><span>lavaan</span><span> </span><span>throws</span><span> </span><span>an</span><span> </span><span>error</span><span> </span><span>because</span><span> </span><span>the</span><span> </span><span>sub</span><span>-</span><span>groups</span><span> </span><span>all</span><span> </span><span>have</span><span> </span><span>N</span><span>=</span><span>1</span><span> </span><span>in</span><span> </span><span>this</span><span> </span><span>approach</span><span>. </span><span>Is</span><span> </span><span>it</span><span> </span><span>possible</span><span> </span><span>to</span><span> </span><span>override</span><span> </span><span>the</span><span> </span><span>check</span><span> </span><span>in</span><span> </span><span>lav_samplestats_from_data</span><span> </span><span>which</span><span> </span><span>resulted</span><span> </span><span>in</span><span> </span><span>the</span><span> </span><span>error</span><span>? </span><span>If</span><span> </span><span>I</span><span> </span><span>understood</span><span> it</span><span> </span><span>correctly</span><span>, </span><span>this</span><span> </span><span>would</span><span> </span><span>allow</span><span> </span><span>for</span><span> </span><span>some</span><span> </span><span>definition</span><span> </span><span>variables</span><span> </span><span>in</span><span> </span><span>lavaan</span><span>. </span></div><br><div><span>Here</span><span> </span><span>is</span><span> </span><span>my</span><span> </span><span>syntax</span><span> </span><span>which</span><span> </span><span>outlines</span><span> </span><span>the</span><span> </span><span>basic</span><span> </span><span>idea</span><span>:</span></div><br><div><span>````</span></div><div><span style=\"font-style:italic\">#### simulate a latent growth curve model with subject-specific times ####</span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">set.seed</span><span>(</span><span>123</span><span>)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">library</span><span>(</span><span>lavaan</span><span>)</span></div><div><span style=\"font-style:italic\">#### Population parameters ####</span></div><div><span>intercept_mu</span><span> </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> </span><span>0</span></div><div><span>intercept_sigma</span><span> </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> </span><span>1</span></div><div><span>slope_mu</span><span> </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> </span><span>.3</span></div><div><span>slope_sigma</span><span> </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> </span><span>1</span></div><br><div><span style=\"font-style:italic\">#### data set ####</span></div><div><span>N</span><span> </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> </span><span>50</span></div><div><span>intercepts</span><span> </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">rnorm</span><span>(</span><span>n</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>N</span><span>, </span></div><div><span>                    </span><span>mean</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>intercept_mu</span><span>, </span></div><div><span>                    </span><span>sd</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>intercept_sigma</span><span>)</span></div><div><span>slopes</span><span> </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">rnorm</span><span>(</span><span>n</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>N</span><span>, </span></div><div><span>                </span><span>mean</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>slope_mu</span><span>, </span></div><div><span>                </span><span>sd</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>slope_sigma</span><span>)</span></div><div><span>times</span><span> </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">matrix</span><span>(</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">seq</span><span>(</span><span>0</span><span>,</span><span>5</span><span>,</span><span>1</span><span>),</span></div><div><span>                </span><span>nrow</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>N</span><span>,</span></div><div><span>                </span><span>ncol</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>6</span><span>,</span></div><div><span>                </span><span>byrow</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>TRUE</span><span>) </span><span>+</span></div><div><span>  </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">cbind</span><span>(</span><span>0</span><span>,</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">matrix</span><span>(</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">round</span><span>(</span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">runif</span><span>(</span><span>n</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>N</span><span>*</span><span>5</span><span>, </span><span>min</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>-</span><span>.2</span><span>,</span><span>max</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>.2</span><span>),</span><span>2</span><span>),</span></div><div><span>                 </span><span>nrow</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>N</span><span>,</span></div><div><span>                 </span><span>ncol</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>5</span><span>,</span></div><div><span>                 </span><span>byrow</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>TRUE</span><span>)) </span><span style=\"font-style:italic\"># we add some jitter to make the times person-specific</span></div><br><div><span>lgcData</span><span> </span><span>&lt;-</span><span> </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">matrix</span><span>(</span><span>NA</span><span>, </span><span>nrow</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>N</span><span>, </span><span>ncol</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">ncol</span><span>(</span><span>times</span><span>), </span><span>dimnames</span><span> </span><span>=</span><span> </span><span>list</span><span>(</span><span>NULL</span><span>, </span><span style=\"font-weight:bold\">paste0</span><span>(</span><span>&quot;</span><span>x</span><span>&quot;</span><span>, </span><span>0</span><span>:</span><span>5</span><span>)</span><span>))</spa